                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                        "entry_id": "251ccc09-1aea-3d94-aa3f-fa53cf49c60b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein langjähriger Angestellter in einem Betrieb, einem Haushalt oder Ähnlichem, der sämtliche Arbeiten erledigt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "11335b2e-cba6-45fa-b4b3-4ec620b5d743",
                                "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                                "text": "Darf ich Ihnen Herrn Gmeiler, unser Faktotum, vorstellen?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "452d388b-193f-48e7-b738-a49e8b3a6fc4",
                                "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                                "text": "„Obwohl sich niemand solcher Gefahren bewußter gewesen wäre als das Faktotum selbst, konnte er nicht davon ablassen, seinen falschen Nimbus zu pflegen, so daß sich zwischen den beiden Polen Angst und Hochstapelei das entnervende Dasein seiner späten Tage abspielte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aca86529-18c9-40fd-b95a-51295bfb1b5c",
                                "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                                "text": "„Jóakim war ein Faktotum.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f9a5670-3017-45e3-828c-07e6a3341205",
                                "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                                "text": "„Schu Tung und Kiän Schao, das waren die Phantasienamen, mit denen er seine beiden Faktoten zu rufen pflegte.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72fdef7a-178d-4f9a-8609-d442a949fb31",
                                "sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                                "text": "„Dafür hielten sie sich an Monsieur Hurel, seinem Faktotum, schadlos.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fda0e54c-b367-319c-87f9-db461e2018e0",
                        "entry_id": "251ccc09-1aea-3d94-aa3f-fa53cf49c60b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "eine ältere Person, die als schrullig oder seltsam und gleichzeitig als liebenswert wahrgenommen wird"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32326c2c-284d-42ef-a5f5-1f69a48f91c8",
                                "sense_id": "fda0e54c-b367-319c-87f9-db461e2018e0",
                                "text": "Deine Oma ist ein echtes Faktotum."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8ec4d2f-5654-4741-92ab-fc20c578704b",
                        "source_entry_id": "251ccc09-1aea-3d94-aa3f-fa53cf49c60b",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                        "source_sense_description": "langjähriger, zuverlässiger Angestellter",
                        "target_lang_word": "factotum",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "factotum",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a6ac216-1891-3d24-b3a1-f821230c5f3e",
                                        "entry_id": "9f13d1ea-120e-3ae1-abef-196392b0c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person having many diverse activities or responsibilities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25b7a6a6-e382-3ccb-b2cf-c664d1a3adc9",
                                        "entry_id": "9f13d1ea-120e-3ae1-abef-196392b0c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A general servant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56aa6c45-8003-4410-9aff-efb077042ae0",
                                                "sense_id": "25b7a6a6-e382-3ccb-b2cf-c664d1a3adc9",
                                                "text": "I had almost forgotten Monee, the grinning old man who prepared our meal. […] He was Po-Po’s factotum—cook, butler, and climber of the bread-fruit and cocoa-nut trees; and, added to all else, a mighty favourite with his mistress; with whom he would sit smoking and gossiping by the hour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "545ffcc9-c9ce-4376-a0ec-ccdc08a87d95",
                                                "sense_id": "25b7a6a6-e382-3ccb-b2cf-c664d1a3adc9",
                                                "text": "Susan Bonner’s mistress hearing of Strong’s arrival sent for him at this juncture, and the Chevalier went up to her ladyship not without hopes that he should find her more tractable than her factotum Mrs. Bonner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "186d36d8-6c03-38b8-82f9-54509de9f4e5",
                                        "entry_id": "9f13d1ea-120e-3ae1-abef-196392b0c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person employed to do all sorts of duties."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33cf0f6d-ef8f-4832-bafc-cc9077ac2061",
                                                "sense_id": "186d36d8-6c03-38b8-82f9-54509de9f4e5",
                                                "text": "Biden’s and Bush’s factotums had to walk their statements quickly back, emphasizing that U.S. policy had not changed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4415d456-6e6d-307c-909d-582b1f92d84f",
                                        "entry_id": "9f13d1ea-120e-3ae1-abef-196392b0c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jack of all trades."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fc9956d-d7be-47e4-85a8-2632850d7680",
                                                "sense_id": "4415d456-6e6d-307c-909d-582b1f92d84f",
                                                "text": "He lives with his devoted sister and factotum, Cyril (Lesley Manville), and a series of women who tend to be quietly eased out when they demand too much time and attention or — heaven forfend! — dare to speak during Woodcock’s monastic creative routine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3bda936e-5b77-39ab-98e2-48be7ddfb873",
                                        "entry_id": "9f13d1ea-120e-3ae1-abef-196392b0c48a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large decorative printing block with a central space into which any letter can be inserted, used to mark the beginning of a chapter of a book in early printing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d43c7022-fbbb-4c51-8a4d-543450fe5411",
                        "source_entry_id": "251ccc09-1aea-3d94-aa3f-fa53cf49c60b",
                        "source_sense_id": "cc80ff7a-3051-3ffd-88f5-185b99709364",
                        "source_sense_description": "langjähriger, zuverlässiger Angestellter",
                        "target_lang_word": "jack of all trades",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jack of all trades",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                        "entry_id": "06ee170b-514f-3afe-b97e-97bc57f34a5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One competent in many endeavours, sometimes regarded as not excelling in any of them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2038f1cb-40f9-4add-ab36-7e56774c5c89",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "Novv for the moſt part your Porter is either ſome broken Cittizen, vvho hath plaid Iack of all trades, ſome Pander, Broker, or Hangman, that hath plaid the knaue vvith all men, and for the more certainty his Embleme is a red Beard, to vvhich Sacke hath made his Noſe couſin German."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14e7aa89-7087-4a0f-aff5-57d6e325c62e",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "Printer, postmaster, almanac maker, essayist, chemist, orator, tinker, statesman, humorist, philosopher, parlor man, political economist, professor of housewifery, ambassador, projector, maxim-monger, herb-doctor, wit:—Jack of all trades, master of each and mastered by none—the type and genius of his land."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dce0a0ce-f2b1-47f1-b5f6-92f17db576c8",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "\"I am my own engineer, and my own carpenter, and my own plumber, and my own gardener, and my own Jack of all Trades,\" said Wemmick, in acknowledging my compliments."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d63874e2-b499-49e2-b834-227b7d75d73f",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "A fellow can always get some sort of a job—I was coming up here to see if they needed an extra clerk or a waiter, or chauffeur, or anything that meant a roof and something to eat—but I suppose they don't need a jack-of-all-trades."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f07cbfdf-b61e-42c3-aa9b-118c204fe866",
                                                "sense_id": "e4b2332d-4d9d-32b4-8baf-336cd702c4f5",
                                                "text": "In 1823, when this drawing was made, there was anesthesia for dentistry and in fact very little dentistry except the extraction of teeth. Much of this extraction was conducted by itinerant quacks or jacks-of-all-trades who did it as a side line to their business."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "24a095cb-d293-4170-812c-97ac727840d4",
